    dc:isPartOf <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch17-06--grok>.
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch17-06--grok--data-adequacy> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LLMClaimAssessment>;
